    "probe_text": "Here is every validation and side-effect applied when creating an owner via `POST /api/owners`, in execution order. The handler is `OwnerRestControllerV1.addOwner` (`src/main/java/org/springframework/samples/petclinic/rest/controller/v1/OwnerRestControllerV1.java:147-182`).\n\n## Phase 1 \u2014 Framework-level, before the method body\n\n1. **Authorization** \u2014 `@PreAuthorize(\"hasRole(@roles.OWNER_ADMIN)\")`. Denial \u2192 403.\n2. **Bean Validation on `OwnerFieldsDto`** (`@Valid @RequestBody`), any violation \u2192 400:\n   - `firstName` \u2014 `@NotNull`, `@Pattern(^[\\p{L}]+([ '-][\\p{L}]+){0,2}$)`, `@Size(1..30)`\n   - `lastName` \u2014 `@NotNull`, `@Pattern(...\\.?$)`, `@Size(1..30)`\n   - `address` \u2014 `@NotNull`, `@Size(1..255)`\n   - `city` \u2014 `@NotNull`, `@Size(1..80)`\n   - `telephone` \u2014 `@NotNull`, `@Size(1..20)`\n   - `email` \u2014 `@Size(max 255)` (optional)\n   - `postcode` \u2014 `@Pattern(^[0-9]{4}$)` (optional)\n   - `registrationDate`, `birthDate` \u2014 `@Valid` (optional)\n\n## Phase 2 \u2014 Controller method body, in order\n\n3. **Address normalization** *(side-effect: mutates DTO)* \u2014 trim, collapse whitespace, upper-case, expand ST/RD/AVE. Non-throwing.\n4. **Required-field / blank check** \u2014 `OwnerFieldsValidator.validateRequiredFields` rejects blank firstName, lastName, address (post-normalization), city, telephone \u2192 400.\n5. **Map DTO \u2192 `Owner` entity** (MapStruct); `id`/`pets` ignored, `sharesHousehold` not persisted.\n6. **Telephone normalization + validation** *(mutates entity)* \u2014 strip formatting, apply default country +61, enforce E.164 length \u2192 400 on failure.\n7. **Email normalization + validation** *(mutates entity)* \u2014 null passes; else regex-check and lower-case \u2192 400.\n8. **Disposable-domain policy** \u2014 reject mailinator/tempmail/guerrillamail \u2192 400.\n9. **Postcode/city validation** \u2014 null passes; else region resolved from city and checked \u2192 400.\n10. **Future registration-date check** \u2014 reject dates after today \u2192 400.\n11. **Registration-date defaulting + business-day adjustment** *(mutates entity)* \u2014 default null to today, roll weekends forward to Monday.\n12. **Daily registration capacity** \u2014 `findAllOwners()` scan, cap 100/day \u2192 429.\n13. **Household id assignment** *(mutates entity)* \u2014 SHA-256 of lastName+postcode.\n14. **Household duplicate checks** *(only if `sharesHousehold != TRUE`)*:\n    - Reject if an existing owner shares the household id (`findAllOwners()` scan) \u2192 409.\n    - Possible-duplicate detection (`findAllOwners()` scan): same last name + postcode, different phone \u2192 *(mutates entity: sets `possibleDuplicateOf`)*, non-throwing.\n15. **City capacity** \u2014 `findAllOwners()` scan, cap 50/city \u2192 409.\n16. **Namesake count** *(mutates entity)* \u2014 `findAllOwners()` scan, count same first+last.\n17. **Household size** *(mutates entity)* \u2014 `findAllOwners()` scan, members + 1.\n18. **Customer code** *(mutates entity)* \u2014 `<REGION>-<HASH8>` from region/telephone/lastName.\n\n## Phase 3 \u2014 Persistence\n\n19. **Save** \u2014 `clinicService.saveOwner` \u2192 `ownerRepository.save` (`@Transactional`); DB-generated id.\n20. **`@PrePersist` callback** (`Owner.defaultRegistrationDate`) fires on flush \u2014 re-defaults null date + re-applies business-day adjustment (redundant no-op for this path since step 11 already set it). Entity-level constraints (`@NotEmpty`, telephone `@Pattern(^\\+[0-9]{8,15}$)`) also enforced on flush.\n\n## Phase 4 \u2014 Post-persist, in order\n\n21. **Membership number** *(mutates entity, not re-persisted)* \u2014 `<customerCode>-M<YY>`.\n22. **Audit log side-effect** \u2014 one INFO line to the `\"AUDIT\"` logger (id, customerCode, registrationDate, membershipLevel). This is the only logging/notification effect; there is **no email and no event publishing** anywhere in the flow.\n23. **Map entity \u2192 `OwnerDto`**; a MapStruct `@AfterMapping` triggers `BulkSignupWarningEvaluator` (another `findAllOwners()` scan, threshold 80) and stamps a response-only `bulkSignupWarning` flag.\n24. **Response** \u2014 `Location: /api/owners/{id}` header, **201 Created** with the DTO body.\n\n**Notes worth flagging:**\n- The create path performs **~7 full-table `findAllOwners()` scans** (steps 12, 14a, 14b, 15, 16, 17, and 23) \u2014 a significant performance concern.\n- `sharesHousehold=true` is a transient flag that bypasses both duplicate rejection and possible-duplicate detection.\n- The `@PrePersist` logic duplicates the controller's step-11 date handling."
